### local secrets — never commit ###
# Real credentials for this machine. application-local.properties.example is the
# committed template; the real file is created from it and stays out of git.
application-local.properties

### deploy secrets — never commit ###
# Written by deploy/azure-setup.sh: the deployed database password and the JWT signing key.
deploy/.env.azure

